  Normal   SuccessfulCreate      22s   job-controller  Created pod: shorty-fail-sql-b2ftv
  Normal   SuccessfulCreate      2s    job-controller  Created pod: shorty-fail-sql-zd4gh
  Warning  BackoffLimitExceeded  0s    job-controller  Job has reached the specified backoff limit
